TITLE Albite kinetics pH2 200C with Fe2/Fe3 and fixed P H2S
SOLUTION 1
    temp 200
    pH 2 charge
    redox pe
    Fe(3) 4e-3
    Fe(2) 4e-3
    -water 1
GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 5
    H2S(g) 5
KINETICS 1
    Albite
        -m0 1
        -m  1
        -parms 1.0 10
    -steps 10 in 100
    -tol 1e-12
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -time true
    -step true
    -totals Si
END
